# AdsWeb Error Log & Resolutions

## Recorded Errors & Fixes
- **Error 1**: `npx: command not found` in default non-interactive bash subshell.
  - *Cause*: Subshell PATH did not include `/home/nishu/.nvm/versions/node/v24.16.0/bin`.
  - *Resolution*: Include node/npm/bun path in subshell commands (`export PATH=$PATH:/home/nishu/.nvm/versions/node/v24.16.0/bin:/home/nishu/.bun/bin`).
- **Error 2**: Missing Web Apps & Tools listing on Dashboard.
  - *Cause*: Apps dataset existed with 120 entries but was not surfaced in Dashboard or Sidebar navigation.
  - *Resolution*: Wired `appsData` into `components/Dashboard.tsx` and `components/Sidebar.tsx` with category badges, interactive search, and deep-links to `/apps/[slug]`.
- **Error 3**: Stale build chunk mismatch risks during static re-deploys.
  - *Cause*: Browser caching of previous JS chunks can produce `ChunkLoadError` when users navigate between dynamic pages.
  - *Resolution*: Implemented `components/ErrorBoundary.tsx` that catches chunk loading failures and executes `clearStaleBuildCache()` automatically.
